{"5005570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dynamic Breach","steam_appid":5005570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5020960,5200070],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Breach is a top-down tactical shooter, military and gothic, of necro-technological horror. You command a squad of AI-driven allies through Requiem: 33 operations across 6 acts, each on its own hand-made map. Alongside the campaign, Onslaught pits your squad against waves of mercenaries and the undead. All of it plays offline, against bots: the campaign, the horde mode and every versus mode.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/2306d73b4bf40668d90b3d45a0289272.poster.avif?t=1793642683\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/2306d73b4bf40668d90b3d45a0289272.webm?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/2306d73b4bf40668d90b3d45a0289272.mp4?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REQUIEM - THE CAMPAIGN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33 operations, 6 acts, a hand-made map for each. Plus one hidden operation. Cutscenes, and several endings depending on the choices you make. The campaign can also be played in co-op.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/c4e43e20cb7c8db048c60d4664523b2b.poster.avif?t=1793642683\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/c4e43e20cb7c8db048c60d4664523b2b.webm?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/c4e43e20cb7c8db048c60d4664523b2b.mp4?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEVEN CLASSES, SEVEN ABILITIES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Medic - healing aura (Rally)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Phantom - cloak<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shield - deployable barrier<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gunner - dig in<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Assault - push<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engineer - proximity mine<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recon - recon drone<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >41 WEAPONS AND THE BLACK-TECH<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >41 weapons, from the issue sidearm to energy weapons, unlocked as you level up. And black-tech gear for whoever can afford it: force field, dampening weave, fission, plasma and singularity grenades.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global level and grade, earned by playing, unlock the arsenal and cap upgrades. Upgrades are shared across the squad; levels belong to each operator individually.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONSLAUGHT - THE HORDE MODE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed waves of mercenaries and the undead, and a HERALD boss every five waves. Graded operation dossiers, browsable bestiary.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERSUS MODES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Breach - plant and defuse<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Elimination<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team Deathmatch<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Domination<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture the Flag<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extraction - a package to carry out, position drawn at random<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blackout - free-for-all battle royale, closing zone<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All playable against bots, solo, offline.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYING WITH OTHERS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN and online multiplayer through Steam: lobbies, invitations and an Elo ranking. <strong>Before you buy:<\/strong> Dynamic Breach is developed by one person, with no promotion campaign. There is no online community, and public lobbies will be empty at launch. Buy this game for its campaign, its horde mode and its bots. Online versus is a bonus, to be played with friends or on LAN.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALSO<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30+ Steam achievements and Steam Cloud saves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully in English and French: interface, campaign, in-game data<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Breach is a top-down tactical shooter, military and gothic, of necro-technological horror. You command a squad of AI-driven allies through Requiem: 33 operations across 6 acts, each on its own hand-made map. Alongside the campaign, Onslaught pits your squad against waves of mercenaries and the undead. All of it plays offline, against bots: the campaign, the horde mode and every versus mode.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/2306d73b4bf40668d90b3d45a0289272.poster.avif?t=1793642683\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/2306d73b4bf40668d90b3d45a0289272.webm?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/2306d73b4bf40668d90b3d45a0289272.mp4?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REQUIEM - THE CAMPAIGN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33 operations, 6 acts, a hand-made map for each. Plus one hidden operation. Cutscenes, and several endings depending on the choices you make. The campaign can also be played in co-op.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/c4e43e20cb7c8db048c60d4664523b2b.poster.avif?t=1793642683\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/c4e43e20cb7c8db048c60d4664523b2b.webm?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/extras\/c4e43e20cb7c8db048c60d4664523b2b.mp4?t=1793642683\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEVEN CLASSES, SEVEN ABILITIES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Medic - healing aura (Rally)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Phantom - cloak<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shield - deployable barrier<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gunner - dig in<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Assault - push<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engineer - proximity mine<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recon - recon drone<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >41 WEAPONS AND THE BLACK-TECH<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >41 weapons, from the issue sidearm to energy weapons, unlocked as you level up. And black-tech gear for whoever can afford it: force field, dampening weave, fission, plasma and singularity grenades.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global level and grade, earned by playing, unlock the arsenal and cap upgrades. Upgrades are shared across the squad; levels belong to each operator individually.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONSLAUGHT - THE HORDE MODE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed waves of mercenaries and the undead, and a HERALD boss every five waves. Graded operation dossiers, browsable bestiary.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERSUS MODES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Breach - plant and defuse<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Elimination<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team Deathmatch<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Domination<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture the Flag<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extraction - a package to carry out, position drawn at random<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blackout - free-for-all battle royale, closing zone<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All playable against bots, solo, offline.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYING WITH OTHERS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN and online multiplayer through Steam: lobbies, invitations and an Elo ranking. <strong>Before you buy:<\/strong> Dynamic Breach is developed by one person, with no promotion campaign. There is no online community, and public lobbies will be empty at launch. Buy this game for its campaign, its horde mode and its bots. Online versus is a bonus, to be played with friends or on LAN.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALSO<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30+ Steam achievements and Steam Cloud saves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully in English and French: interface, campaign, in-game data<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Top-down tactical shooter, military and gothic, necro-technological horror. Requiem: a solo campaign of 33 operations across 6 acts, on hand-made maps. An AI squad to command, 7 classes, 41 weapons. Onslaught: horde mode, a boss every 5 waves. All modes play against bots, offline.","supported_languages":"English, French","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/15d189f172fd6493564e435d653adc2a554e0387\/header.jpg?t=1793642683","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/af7622b8125003077748e2684a8aec992e7c6b5a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642683","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/af7622b8125003077748e2684a8aec992e7c6b5a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642683","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.4 GHz (Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 capable GPU with 1 GB VRAM (Intel HD Graphics 520 or equivalent). Direct3D 11 fallback included<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1024 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Solo and LAN play work offline. Online play needs Steam and an Internet connection.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 3.0 GHz (Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 5)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with OpenGL 4.6 support and 2 GB VRAM (GeForce GTX 1050 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1024 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> A faster CPU mainly helps in Blackout with many players.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, SteamOS 3, or an equivalent x86-64 distribution<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual core x86-64, 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong>  OpenGL 3.3 capable GPU with 1 GB VRAM (Intel HD 5000, Radeon HD 7000, GeForce GTX 600 or newer). Mesa 22 or newer for AMD and Intel<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1024 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> PulseAudio or PipeWire<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs on X11, or through XWayland on Wayland desktops. Solo and LAN play work offline. Online play needs Steam and an Internet connection.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, SteamOS 3, or an equivalent x86-64 distribution<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad core x86-64, 3.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with OpenGL 4.6 support and 2 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1024 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> PulseAudio or PipeWire<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> A faster CPU mainly helps in Blackout with many players.<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["CinetheZs"],"publishers":["CinetheZs"],"demos":[{"appid":5200070,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1499,"final":1274,"discount_percent":15,"initial_formatted":"$14.99","final_formatted":"$12.74"},"packages":[1736192],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Dynamic Breach","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1736192,"percent_savings_text":"-15% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Dynamic Breach - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$14.99<\/span> $12.74","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1274}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":true},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":47,"description":"LAN PvP"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":48,"description":"LAN Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":64,"description":"Adjustable Text Size"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/4f6da3aa0eb230a29154d4e63b3d2f6bc43bd128\/ss_4f6da3aa0eb230a29154d4e63b3d2f6bc43bd128.600x338.jpg?t=1793642683","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/4f6da3aa0eb230a29154d4e63b3d2f6bc43bd128\/ss_4f6da3aa0eb230a29154d4e63b3d2f6bc43bd128.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642683"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/8f4285ab2423bbef41ee644916ef045d82c31d19\/ss_8f4285ab2423bbef41ee644916ef045d82c31d19.600x338.jpg?t=1793642683","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/8f4285ab2423bbef41ee644916ef045d82c31d19\/ss_8f4285ab2423bbef41ee644916ef045d82c31d19.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642683"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/ad01624722535e76da0bc36d3494b92c3654aa01\/ss_ad01624722535e76da0bc36d3494b92c3654aa01.600x338.jpg?t=1793642683","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/ad01624722535e76da0bc36d3494b92c3654aa01\/ss_ad01624722535e76da0bc36d3494b92c3654aa01.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642683"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/3011036d60bed7976f4d7289f92b2623c1aa0e63\/ss_3011036d60bed7976f4d7289f92b2623c1aa0e63.600x338.jpg?t=1793642683","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/3011036d60bed7976f4d7289f92b2623c1aa0e63\/ss_3011036d60bed7976f4d7289f92b2623c1aa0e63.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642683"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/bb80feda80f7d14709424f971e45a0c1f1ede721\/ss_bb80feda80f7d14709424f971e45a0c1f1ede721.600x338.jpg?t=1793642683","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/bb80feda80f7d14709424f971e45a0c1f1ede721\/ss_bb80feda80f7d14709424f971e45a0c1f1ede721.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642683"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/b575c2fd45374e0d15d84b727e5dc654adb527cc\/ss_b575c2fd45374e0d15d84b727e5dc654adb527cc.600x338.jpg?t=1793642683","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/b575c2fd45374e0d15d84b727e5dc654adb527cc\/ss_b575c2fd45374e0d15d84b727e5dc654adb527cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642683"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5005570\/d8